  "description": {
    "text": "In the JR Pokémon Stamp Rally of August 2000, children traveled Tokyo's Yamanote Line collecting a stamp at each station in a rally passport. Finishing the gold course won a non-holo copy of the English promo Eevee 11, and the silver course a copy of Mewtwo 12 printed in Japan on Japanese card stock, both handed out in a booklet. Wizards of the Coast gave Eevee 11 out in holofoil, while this Mewtwo differs from the English print in little but a slightly lighter purple.",
